From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a frame shown again un-throttles its child frames

A PDF went blank after its tab or <webview> was hidden and shown again.

- Chrome's PDF viewer is a cross-origin frame; the PDF's page is drawn
  by its child frame.
- Hidden, the viewer throttles that child
  (FrameView::CanThrottleRenderingForPropagation), and a throttled
  frame drops what it painted. LocalFrame::WasHidden() reaches the child
  through a forced intersection update.
- LocalFrame::WasShown() only scheduled a frame. An unchanged layout
  recomputes no intersections, so the child stayed throttled until its
  geometry changed.
- WasShown() propagates the frame's throttling status to its children.

Verified: guard-pdf-after-hiding.sh fails on the engine without this
patch (the page has 0 white pixels after one hide and show, 105108
before). Not built with the patch: the engine job builds it on crux.
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame.cc | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame.cc
index 64d0e9b..15f0b59 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame.cc
@@ -2632,6 +2632,15 @@ void LocalFrame::WasShown() {
   hidden_ = false;
   if (LocalFrameView* frame_view = View()) {
     frame_view->ScheduleAnimation();
+    // Domicile: while hidden, a cross-origin frame throttles its child frames
+    // (FrameView::CanThrottleRenderingForPropagation), and a throttled frame
+    // drops what it painted. WasHidden() reaches the children through an
+    // intersection update. An unchanged layout recomputes no intersections, so
+    // without this a child stays throttled and blank after the frame is shown,
+    // as the PDF viewer's page does after a tab switch.
+    frame_view->UpdateRenderThrottlingStatus(
+        frame_view->IsHiddenForThrottling(), frame_view->IsSubtreeThrottled(),
+        frame_view->IsDisplayLocked(), /*recurse=*/true);
   }
 
   if (auto* content_capture_manager = GetOrResetContentCaptureManager()) {
